# Funnier — canonical vision and repository review

Funnier should become the humour-discovery and taste-learning layer shared by OddHobb and Pogtown. It gives people a reason to visit OddHobb even when they're not buying anything, while building an audience for AI comedians and improving the humour used in personalised gifts.

I've reviewed the three repositories and written the implementation vision.

Funnier — Canonical Vision v1.0

Product vision · Architecture · Credits · Identity · P0–P3 roadmap

